OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day though cloud
OL,6,Fthick enough in the morning for a
OL,7,Flittle light rain in the north. This
OL,8,Fclearing then bright spells and some
OL,9,Fsunshine breaking through, slightly
OL,10,Fwarmer.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry bright evening. The
OL,13,Fsouth and east of Highland will stay
OL,14,Fdry overnight with some clear
OL,15,Fintervals, while cloud and showery
OL,16,Frain reaches the Northwest and Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
