OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FThe Isles and Northwest
OL,6,FHighlands will be cloudy with showery
OL,7,Frain, some heavy. East Highland
OL,8,Fbrighter with sunny intervals and a
OL,9,Ffew showers, and becoming very warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FFurther showers on Thursday,
OL,13,Fespecially northwest, but very warm in
OL,14,Feast. Bright spells and a few showers
OL,15,Fon Friday and Saturday, turning cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
